Package: dafthelper
Title: Helper functions for managing a DAFT (data, analysis, figures, text) structured analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("January", "Weiner", , "january.weiner@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simple helper functions for managing a DAFT (data, analysis,
    figures, text) structured analysis. This is not intended for creating
    workflows, but rather for managing a manual, interactive analysis. If
    you have a DAFT structured analysis and you wonder which script
    produced which figure, this package may be of some help.
